<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-VIRU RAND OPERATING PROFIT 8.5 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-VIRU RAND OPERATING PROFIT 8.5 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viru Rand, a listed seafood processing company, said its operating profit for the first half of 1997 was 8.46 million kroons.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that its turnover for the first half of 1997 was 148.8 million kroons.</p>
<p>The company's turnover for 1996 was 250.3 million kroons and the total profit for the same year was 5.6 million kroons.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
